 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Footsteps for turning back on one's heels, geometric for «بل الله مولاكم», wind for the terror cast. Nothing for the Fire. 149:1-3 not glossed: Al-Muyassar's wording there is in Allah's first person. 151: short-word flag (listen). STAGING v4: 149-150: believers in a town and the disbelievers who would command them (speak; Al-Muyassar: فيما يأمرونكم به). The believers do not obey and do not turn back (the turning back is conditional: only the footsteps plate). On «بل الله مولاكم» the geometric plate, and the believers raise their hands, taking Him as their protector (As-Sa'di: الحث لهم على اتخاذه وحده وليا وناصرا). 151 stays ambient: the terror cast into the enemy and the Fire."
 },
